// its callee-saved regs by PUSH/POP instead of to frame slots, and needs no rbp/sub-rsp/leave at all — matching
// what gcc emits for a leaf-of-registers recursion. These push/pop the used r12/r13/r14 (pop in reverse order).
fn _reg_push_all(code, slots) {
