// Emit the guard (base case) BEFORE the reg-save pushes: eval left→rax, cmp with right, jump-if-false past the
// return, then `mov rax,<ret>; ret`. Falls through to the caller-supplied prologue when the guard is false.
fn _emit_shrinkwrap_guard(code, guard, params) {
