// backend's unchecked 64-bit arithmetic, to a three-register linear loop. The
// checked-overflow mode keeps the recursive tree so the first trap and its
// evaluation order remain unchanged. Near matches fail closed to TRMA/general
// codegen rather than receiving a speculative transformation.
