// Tail recursion modulo addition (TRMA). For the tightly proven shape
//
//   if base { return value; }
//   return self(left) + self(right);
//
// preserve the left-to-right evaluation order but execute the right recursive
// branch by looping in the current frame. This is valid for the integer native
// backend because addition is associative modulo the machine word. Requiring
